        "abstract": "This paper contains the results of measurements made upon several magnetic tapes used in the direct recording of seismic data. The parameters measured included dynamic range, distortion, noise and frequency response. All measurements were made under similar conditions so that direct comparisons would be meaningful. Normalization procedures were carried out in such a way that the data can be correlated to other recording equipment.",
